+# Feature Specification: Long-Rental Discount
+
+**Feature Branch**: `003-long-rental-discount`
+**Created**: 2026-11-11
+**Input**: "A rental of 3 days or more now costs 10% less than its full price. Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total."
+
+## Requirements
+
+- **FR-001**: A period of 3 or more days costs 90% of days x dailyPrice; shorter periods cost the full price.
+- **FR-002**: `quote` and `book` both return the reduced total (one shared pricing rule).
+- **FR-003**: Totals stay integer euro cents.
+
+## Assumptions (open question settled by default; no one to ask in this session)
+
+- Rounding: the 10%-off total is rounded to the nearest cent, halves up (`Math.round(full * 9 / 10)`).
+- The discount applies to the whole rental, not only the days beyond the third.
+- The threshold counts rental days (end - start), as for the full price.
+
+## Success Criteria
+
+- 2 days: full price; 3 days: 90%; 7 days: 90%; quote total equals booking total.
